    <item>
      <title>现代汽车8月全球销量跌破30万辆，韩国本土暴跌41.1%至11年最低</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260901/%E7%8E%B0%E4%BB%A3%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A68%E6%9C%88%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E9%94%80%E9%87%8F%E8%B7%8C%E7%A0%B430%E4%B8%87%E8%BE%86%E9%9F%A9%E5%9B%BD%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%9F%E6%9A%B4%E8%B7%8C41.1%E8%87%B311%E5%B9%B4%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
